        "en": "How does the algebraic product compare with intersection?"
      },
      "bloom": "Understand",
      "answer": 3,
      "options": [
        {
          "ar": "الضرب أكبر أو يساوي التقاطع",
          "en": "product is at least intersection"
        },
        {
          "ar": "الضرب يساوي الاتحاد دائماً",
          "en": "product always equals union"
        },
